  "referenceNumber": "RUS0047",
  "remarks": "\n‘Elected leader’ of the so-called ‘Luhansk People’s Republic’. In taking on and acting in this capacity, and in participating formally as a candidate in the so-called ‘elections’ of 11 November 2018 in the so-called ‘ Luhansk People’s Republic’, he actively supported and implemented actions and policies which undermine the territorial integrity, sovereignty and independence of Ukraine, and further destabilised Ukraine. The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
